# Development build

## Mokolé
- Play as the Mokolé, the werecrocodiles and weredragons. Customize your warform with numerous features. Explore ancient memories through Mnesis. Forge items of great power. Dream of dinosaurs and dragons, then summon them as MAA and mounts.
- Added a Mokolé sub bookmark
- Play as one of the following Streams:
	- The Stream of Earth, Mokolé-mbembe of Africa
	- The Stream of Fire, Gumagan of Australia and the South Eastern Islands
	- The Stream of Air, Makara of India and Asia
	- The Stream of Water, Zhong Lung of Asia
- 7 Solar Auspices for Mokolé-mbembe and Gumagan
- 4 Seasonal Auspices for Makara
- 4 Seasonal Wind Auspices for Zhong Lung
- 8 Suchid Forms: Choose your Suchid(animal) form at the start of the game. Choices available depend on your Stream
- Archid Form: The ferocious warform of the Mokolé can be uniquely customized as you gain Fera Rank. Additional form features can be obtained from other sources as well. Perhaps your form has a giant horn? Or constricting coils? A resplendent crest? Fins? Webbed Feet? Armored Scales? Maybe all of those and more.
- 5 Mokolé Lifestyle Trees:
	- Common Gifts: Perks available to all Mokolé. Gain the ability to breathe fire(in duels too), walk the Umbra, and sing the Song of the Great Beast.
	- Stream Gifts: 4 perks trees, 1 for each Stream. Extend your Silver Claws as the Mokolé-mbembe and take vengeance on the Garou. As a Makara make your arrows blot out the sun so you can fight in the shade. Force nightmares into your foes as a Gumagan. Command the storms and blizzards as the mighty Zhong Lung. 
	- Solar Auspice Gifts: 7 perk trees, one for each Solar Auspice (Makara and Zhong Lung Auspices overlap with these). If I described each of these we'd be here all day, go play instead!
	- Mnesis: One very large tree that replaces Planetary Gifts. Learn the crafting arts of the Mokolé and the powers they wielded as the Lizard Kings of old.
- Mnesis Journey: Enter a slumber and use the Mokolé powers of Mnesis to remember the ancient memories of your race.
- 5 Dynasty Legacies. One common for all Mokolé, and one for each Stream. 
- 5 common buildings, 1 Stream unique building, and their own Duchy building
- 9 Special buildings
- 20 Fetish artifacts. Many of these can be used by other Fera when obtained from Spirit Quests.
- A very large domicile that interacts with nearly all Mokolé and Fera mechanics.
- Avoid the Innocents as you delve into the Umbra to dream of various fantastical dinosaurs, then recruit them as Dinosaurs-at-Arms.
- Follow one of 8 Mokolé faiths with many new faith tenets:
	- Join the Osirian League as one of the Children of Sobek. 
	- Avenge the Fera in Africa as a Warrior of Entoban. 
	- Bring Balance to India as a follower of the Cosmic Order.
	- Sail the waters and sands as a mystical believer of the Dreaming Sands
	- Command the Rivers from your mountain as the Dragons of Zhong Guo
	- Regale the Beast Courts of your history as a member of the Emerald Memory
	- Stand alone against the world as your Eternal Breath strengthens your body
	- Eat the memories of the Mokolé as a fallen Mnetic
- Seek out multiple objectives which are available to the different Streams and faiths.
- Empower your Clutch with new Mokolé totems. Call upon Dragon, Finch, Scarab, and many more.
- Craft legendary armaments through the power of Sunforging and Mnesis.
- And more, stop reading and go play already.

