  - Hellfire: Small tweaks in modifiers, and aggravated damage deal upon combat
  - Illusion: Complete Overhaul, now having interesting twist with imaginary MaA
  - Necromancy: Added undead MaA
  - Oneiromancy: Complete Overhaul, more focused on inducing insanity
  - Quintessence Manipulation: Small tweak to 5 and 6th perk
  - Shadows: Complete Overhaul, a mix of combat and utility in heists
  - Shapeshifting: Complete Overhaul
